<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Valentina Beauty - Beleza e Estética</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #050505;
      color: #e1e4e8;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    header {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #120305 0%, #050505 100%);
      border-bottom: 2px solid #800020;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    header h1 {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 36px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      text-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(128, 0, 32, 0.6);
    }
    header p {
      color: #D4AF37;
      font-size: 15px;
      margin-top: 8px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    .badge-elite {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: rgba(128, 0, 32, 0.3);
      color: #D4AF37;
      border: 1px solid #D4AF37;
      padding: 6px 18px;
      border-radius: 25px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-top: 15px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    }
    .main-container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 45px auto;
      padding: 0 15px;
    }
    .banner-section {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }
    .banner-card {
      background-color: #0d0d0d;
      border: 1px solid #800020;
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 35px rgba(128, 0, 32, 0.35);
    }
    .banner-card img {
      width: 100%;
      max-height: 450px;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
    }
    .grid-produtos {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      gap: 30px;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .card-produto {
      background-color: #0a0a0c;
      border: 1px solid #212125;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 22px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
    }
    .card-produto:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
      border-color: #800020;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(128, 0, 32, 0.4);
    }
    .img-container {
      width: 100%;
      height: 260px;
      background-color: #030303;
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .img-container img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 12px;
      transition: transform 0.4s ease;
    }
    .card-produto:hover .img-container img {
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }
    .card-header h3 {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .card-header .categoria {
      color: #D4AF37;
      font-size: 12px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    }
    .descricao-produto {
      font-size: 13.5px;
      color: #9ea7b0;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      border-top: 1px solid #1a1a1e;
      padding-top: 12px;
    }
    .preco-box {
      margin-top: 10px;
      border-top: 1px solid #1a1a1e;
      padding-top: 16px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .preco-box .valor {
      color: #D4AF37;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.25);
    }
    .btn-comprar {
      background-color: #800020;
      color: #ffffff;
      border: none;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      border-radius: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-block;
    }
    .btn-comprar:hover {
      background-color: #a30029;
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(128, 0, 32, 0.6);
    }
    footer {
      background-color: #020202;
      border-top: 1px solid #1a1a1e;
      padding: 45px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 60px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <h1>Valentina Beauty</h1>
    <p>Beleza, Estética e Cuidados Especiais</p>
    <div class="badge-elite">Coleção Exclusiva</div>
  </header>

  <main class="main-container">
    <section class="banner-section">
      <div class="banner-card">
        <img src="d964e30d516e2cc446cd1c8bcd4ca22f.jpg" alt="Banner Principal">
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="grid-produtos">
      <div class="card-produto">
        <div>
          <div class="img-container">
            <img src="pai411c2eee6e76f02c55700efb4df2f.jpg" alt="Glossy Bubble Oil">
          </div>
          <div class="card-header">
            <span class="categoria">Lábios</span>
            <h3>Glossy Bubble Oil</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="descricao-produto">Hidratação profunda e brilho intenso para os lábios com acabamento radiante.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="preco-box">
          <span class="valor">R$ 59,90</span>
          <a href="#" class="btn-comprar">Comprar</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card-produto">
        <div>
          <div class="img-container">
            <img src="d64295ce53f6af3c56e5c5bf8f70097.jpg" alt="Pincéis de Maquiagem">
          </div>
          <div class="card-header">
            <span class="categoria">Acessórios</span>
            <h3>Kit Pincéis Elegance</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="descricao-produto">Conjunto completo de pincéis com cerdas macias para uma aplicação perfeita.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="preco-box">
          <span class="valor">R$ 89,90</span>
          <a href="#" class="btn-comprar">Comprar</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Valentina Beauty - Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
